  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed infill building fails to enhance the setting\r\nof the locally listed host building due to the poor quality design viewed as an\r\nincongruous addition contrary to Policy(s) 53, 74 and 75 of the adopted Waltham Forest\r\nLocal Plan LP1 (2024).",
    "Notwithstanding the first point of refusal, due to a lack of information in relation to a Outline Construction Logistics Plan, an adequate assessment could not be made in relation to how the proposed development would be built or serviced without severely affecting the public highway contrary to Policy 65&nbsp;of the Waltham Forest adopted Local Plan Pt 1 (2024).&nbsp;"
